 "scratch": "设计算式 1.25 × 3.2 × 0.25。将 3.2 拆分为 0.8 × 4。利用结合律：(1.25 × 0.8) × (4 × 0.25) = 1 × 1 = 1。检查：1.25*3.2=4, 4*0.25=1。正确。",
 "solver_code": "from decimal import Decimal\ndef solve():\n    # 模拟简便运算逻辑\n    a = Decimal('1.25')\n    b_part1 = Decimal('0.8')\n    b_part2 = Decimal('4')\n    c = Decimal('0.25')\n    \n    # (1.25 * 0.8) * (4 * 0.25)\n    part1 = a * b_part1\n    part2 = b_part2 * c\n    result = part1 * part2\n    return [result]",
 "figure": null,
 "stem": "计算：$1.25 \\times 3.2 \\times 0.25=$____",
 "options": [],
